// Writer (Survey), wave 1b. Survey assistant; sarcastic, competitive; labels everything twice; the lost-property box; pressed flowers.
tpl: dry
talk: Sarcastic and quick, competitive about small things. Labels everything twice and sees no joke in it. Quietly in charge of the lost-property box and very proud of its system. Presses flowers from the garden, which he doesn't advertise. With other juniors: sharp, then helpful. Mood tells: when lonely he gets more sarcastic; when happy he shows you a flower.
